---
// The site mark: the studio name written as a method call, applied.theory().
// Live type in the ink colour, with the dot and parentheses in the signal
// colour. Decorative, so hidden from assistive tech (the link around it
// carries the name). Sized by --mark (default 18px).
---
<span class="mark" aria-hidden="true">applied<i>.</i>theory<i>()</i></span>

<style>
  .mark {
    font-family: var(--font-wordmark);
    font-size: var(--mark, 18px);
    font-weight: 500;
    font-stretch: normal;
    letter-spacing: -0.05em;
    line-height: 1;
    text-transform: none;
    white-space: nowrap;
    color: var(--c-ink);
  }
  i {
    font-style: normal;
    color: var(--c-signal);
  }
</style>
